// Capsule sales/billing — compile entry for Invoice + Payment + PaymentMethod.
// CollectionCase / deposits / PaymentRefundAttempt / InvoiceLine deferred (OD040).
// EventCancelled voids unpaid draft/sent/viewed/overdue invoices (D041).

use "./payment.manifest"

// Event cancellation voids unpaid invoices still in draft/sent/viewed/overdue.
// ~~Paid/partial invoices are skipped by markVoided's amountPaid guard.~~
// Correction (2026-07-20): Manifest fan-out does not skip on guard failure —
// a paid invoice in the set aborts the whole Event.cancel transaction. Prefer
// confirming unpaid-only selection before relying on this cascade in ops.
on EventCancelled fanOut Invoice where eventId = payload.eventId
  run markVoided
  params { reason: payload.reason }
